  "description": "<div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><strong>&bull; Brand introduction:</strong> Rogue Wave is<strong>&nbsp;</strong>on a mission to make our oceans plastic free and reduce use of fossil fuels by creating better products with better materials.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><strong>&bull; Product description:</strong> We use biopolymers, which means our plastics are made mostly from plants. Our products are BPA-free, worry free, help reduce carbon emissions, keep plastics out of the ocean, and support a vision for a truly circular economy by designing waste out of the equation. After a long and useful life, your Rogue Wave beach toys will compost back to the earth.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><strong>&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point):</strong> Our material is made from a proprietary blend of compostable plastics derived from renewable feedstocks. This unique compostable material not only reduces the impact of traditional plastics on our environment, it also delivers the strength and heat resistance needed for functional parts.&nbsp; And our favorite part? It&rsquo;s compostable per ASTM D6400 standards. Selecting bio-based material obtained from renewable resources reduces the carbon footprint of the plastic itself. Some calculations show that this process can reduce greenhouse gas emissions by 50% to 80% compared to petroleum-based counterparts (Cok et al., 2014).</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><strong>&bull; Payment terms:</strong> Monthly</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><strong>&bull; Other information:</strong> Beach toys are only the beginning! We want to make better products using better material, and not just at the beach. Our material is available for anyone ready to replace conventional plastic with a better alternative.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">For more information, you can view our <a href=\"https://www.canva.com/design/DAFsaD75vA8/QYwUJD8D4qDtxP5AmqQhlw/view?utm_content=DAFsaD75vA8&amp;utm_campaign=designshare&amp;utm_medium=link&amp;utm_source=publishsharelink\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">affiliate handbook here</a>.</p>\r\n</div>",
